        "original_id": "64702f13-22e3-5545-9634-ed3c1d694f30",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2018 Texas gubernatorial election, 2018 United States Senate election in Texas\n- Places: Texas, United States\n- Roles: Governor of Texas, U.S. Senator\n- Topics: Election scheduling, concurrent elections\n\nFacts:\n- The 2018 Texas gubernatorial election was scheduled to take place on November 6, 2018, to elect the Governor of Texas.\n- The 2018 United States Senate election in Texas was scheduled to be held on November 6, 2018.\n- The 2018 Texas gubernatorial election was scheduled concurrently with the election for Texas's Class I U.S. Senate seat.\n- The 2018 Texas gubernatorial election was also scheduled alongside other United States Senate elections, United States House of Representatives elections, and various Texas and local elections.\n- The 2018 United States Senate election in Texas was scheduled along with other United States Senate elections and United States House of Representatives elections in additional states.",
